@startuml
title Sequence diagram

actor User
participant "Engagement" as Engagement #purple
participant "Party Interaction" as PartyInteraction #red
participant "Product Configurator" as ProductConfigurator
participant "Product Order Capture" as ProductOrderCapture
participant "Product Catalog" as ProductCatalog
participant "Product Inventory" as ProductInventory
participant "Location" as Location

== QUOTE CONFIGURATION - COMPUTE QUOTE ITEMS ==

User -> Engagement : 42. Selected Main Offering to Configure\n(SASE Contract)
Engagement -> PartyInteraction : 43. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPATCH processFlow/1/taskFlow/1.3\n(characteristic(interactionItem.id=1,reason="**Configure Main Offering**",\nproductOffering="SASE Contract"))
activate PartyInteraction

note over PartyInteraction
  task 3 completed
  task 4 "Configure Quote"
  update interaction item
  (**TMF683 Party Interaction**)
  hold
end note

PartyInteraction -> ProductOrderCapture : 44. **TMF701 Process Flow**\nPOST /processFlow (processFlowSpecification=ConfigureQuote,\nchannel="B2B eCommerce Portal",\nrelatedParty(id,name="Alice&Bob",role="B2B Customer"),\ncharacteristic(quoteItem="**SASE Contract**" (.,productCharacteristic,productOfferingPriceRef,\nplace=[Country,Region],.)))\ncallback when information provided (processFlow.id=1,taskFlow.id=1.4)
activate ProductOrderCapture

note over ProductOrderCapture
  task 1 "Initialize Quotation"
  **TMF 648 Quote**
  create Quote (Initial Root Quote Item Configuration)
  completed
  task 2 "Compute Quote Items and Allowed Actions", active
end note

ProductOrderCapture -> ProductConfigurator : 45. **TMF760 Product Configuration**\nPOST /queryProductConfiguration\n(.,contextEntity = quote id,requestProductConfigurationItem(..product(\nplace=[Country,Region],productOffering.id,..))\n//Request for SASE Root Quote Item Configuration//
activate ProductConfigurator

ProductConfigurator -> ProductCatalog : 46. **TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt**\nGET /productOffering/{id}
activate ProductCatalog
ProductCatalog --> ProductConfigurator : 47. **TMF620** OK\n(productOffering with characteristics, pricing policy)
deactivate ProductCatalog

ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 48. Identify Possible Product Dependencies,\nBuild a check for Regions with existing Underlay Connectivity

ProductConfigurator -> ProductInventory : 49. **TMF637 Product Inventory**\nGET /product?partyID=AliceBob.id&place=[regions]&product="Subscriber Underlay Connectivity Service"
activate ProductInventory
ProductInventory --> ProductConfigurator : 50. **TMF637** 200 OK (list of products and related location references (places with Regions))
deactivate ProductInventory

loop for each site of a customer

    ProductConfigurator -> Location : 51. **TMF674 Geographic Site** GET /geographicSite/{id}
    activate Location
    Location --> ProductConfigurator : 52. **TMF674 Geographic Site** 200 OK (siteFeature.name, place geographic address ref)

    ProductConfigurator -> Location : 53. **TMF673 Geographic Address** GET /geographicAddress/{id}
    Location --> ProductConfigurator : 54. **TMF673 Geographic Address** 200 OK (site address)
    deactivate Location

end

ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 55. Buld Product Configuration (Characteristics, Prices and Child Offerings to display),\nlist of actions (specify #of Actors,.., pick Child offerings)
ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 56. List of Child Offerings that might be selected and configured defined\nStart Computation of Child Offerings

loop for each defined Child offering

    ProductConfigurator -> ProductCatalog : 57. **TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt**\nGET /productOffering/{id}
    activate ProductCatalog
    ProductCatalog --> ProductConfigurator : 58. **TMF620** 200 OK\n(productOffering with characteristics, pricing policy)
    deactivate ProductCatalog

    ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 59. Identify Possible Product Dependencies,\nIdentify offerings that need existing locations
    ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 60. Read cache of obtained Subscriber Underlay Connectivity products\nto build list of locations (places with addresses)

end

loop for each defined Child offering

    alt where subscriber underlay connectivity availablity check is needed\n(Actor Access Connection, SASE Edge Appliance)

        ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 61. Build Product Configuration, allowed actions\n(provide location, list of locations to choose from)

    else where subscriber underlay connectivity availability check is not needed (DNS, FWaaS, ZTNA)

        ProductConfigurator -> ProductConfigurator : 62. Build Product Configuration, allowed actions\n(provide #of Actors)

    end

end

ProductConfigurator --> ProductOrderCapture : 63. **TMF760 Product Configuration**\n200 OK\n(queryProductConfiguration.id, contextEntity = quote id,  State=Done\n[computedProductConfigurationItem(Configured Quote Item, Allowed actions)])\n//Combined Response for all Quote Items//
deactivate ProductConfigurator

note over ProductOrderCapture
  task 2 "Compute Quote Items and Allowed Actions"
  (Prices to be displayed,
  Characteristis values to be set defined,
  List of Child offerings that are selectable defined)
  completed
  task 3 "Complete Quote Items",
  Get Root Item Characteristic values, Selected Child offerings
  Get Child Characteristic values [and Locations] from Customer"
  hold
end note

ProductOrderCapture --> PartyInteraction : 64. **TMF701 Process Flow**\n201 Created (processFlow.id=3,state=active,\n"Computed/Configured Quote Items, list of locations, Allowed actions"\ncallback when information provided(processFlow.id=3,taskFlow.id=3.3))\n//TaskTask Flow Information Required:\nRoot Quote Item characteristic values,\nSelected Child Quote Items and thier characteristic values (including locations)//
deactivate ProductOrderCapture

PartyInteraction --> Engagement : 65. **TMF701 Process Flow**\n200 OK\n"Computed/Configured Quote Items, list of locations, Allowed actions"\ncallback when information provided(processFlow.id=3,taskFlow.id=3.3))\n//TaskTask Flow Information Required:\nRoot Quote Item characteristic values,\nSelected Child Quote Items and thier characteristic values (including locations)//
deactivate PartyInteraction

Engagement -> Engagement : 66. Build UI for Root and Child Offerings,\nallowed configuration actions\nand next Offerings

Engagement --> User : 67. Present Offerings and actions\n(specify #of Actors,.., pick Child offerings,\nspecify locations and set values for Childs)

Engagement --> User : Screen Flow (6)

loop for every entered OFF-NET location

    Engagement -> Location : 68. **TMF673 Geographic Address** POST /geographicAddressValidation (submittedGeographicAddress)
    activate Location
    Engagement --> User : Screen Flow (7)
    Location --> Engagement : 69. **TMF673 Geographic Address** 201 Created (validationResult=success)
    deactivate Location
    Engagement --> User : Screen Flow (7)

end

Engagement --> User : Screen Flow (8-13)

@enduml
